{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And Israel settled in the land of the Amorites.</b> From all that has been recounted it is clarified that Israel at that time did not settle in the land of Moab, but did settle in the land of the Amorites, as Jephthah explained when he said (Judges 11:15): לֹא לָקַח יִשְׂרָאֵל אֶת אֶרֶץ מוֹאָב וְאֶת אֶרֶץ בְּנֵי עַמּוֹן."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:35.075519408Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}